<h1>Wholesale Order App - Detailed Change Log</h1>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> October 15, 2026<br>
<strong>Feature:</strong> Product Management &amp; GST Calculation System</p>

<h2>1. Overview of Changes</h2>
<p>Implemented the complete end-to-end "Add Product" and "Products &amp; GST Catalog" feature across both backend (Spring Boot) and frontend (React).</p>
<p>The admin user provides 4 primary inputs:</p>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Product Name</strong></li>
  <li><strong>HSN Code</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Net Rate</strong> (Total Selling Price inclusive of GST)</li>
  <li><strong>Tax (GST %)</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>From these inputs, the system automatically computes:</p>
<div class="formula-box">
  Rate (Excluded Tax / Base Price) = Net Rate / (1 + GST% / 100)<br>
  Tax Amount = Net Rate - Rate<br>
  CGST Value = Tax Amount / 2<br>
  SGST Value = Tax Amount / 2
</div>

