<h2>3. File-by-File Detailed Breakdown</h2>

<h3>File 1: Product.java (Backend Entity)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <code>backend/src/main/java/com/wholesale/orderapp/entity/Product.java</code></li>
  <li><strong>Action:</strong> Created new file.</li>
  <li><strong>Fields:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><code>id</code> (Long): Primary Key (Auto-generated).</li>
      <li><code>name</code> (String): Product Name.</li>
      <li><code>hsnCode</code> (String): HSN code.</li>
      <li><code>netRate</code> (Double): Total selling price inclusive of tax.</li>
      <li><code>taxGst</code> (Double): Tax (GST %).</li>
      <li><code>rate</code> (Double): Automatically computed base rate before tax.</li>
      <li><code>cgstPercent</code> (Double): Central GST percentage (GST / 2).</li>
      <li><code>sgstPercent</code> (Double): State GST percentage (GST / 2).</li>
      <li><code>cgstAmount</code> (Double): Central GST currency amount.</li>
      <li><code>sgstAmount</code> (Double): State GST currency amount.</li>
      <li><code>taxAmount</code> (Double): Total GST currency amount.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Auto-Calculation:</strong> Annotated with <code>@PrePersist</code> and <code>@PreUpdate</code> in <code>calculateTaxFields()</code> so that any created or updated product automatically calculates its Rate, CGST, and SGST.</li>
</ul>

<h3>File 2: ProductRepository.java (Backend Repository)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <code>backend/src/main/java/com/wholesale/orderapp/repository/ProductRepository.java</code></li>
  <li><strong>Action:</strong> Created new file.</li>
  <li><strong>Details:</strong> Extends <code>JpaRepository&lt;Product, Long&gt;</code>, includes case-insensitive name searching.</li>
</ul>

<h3>File 3: ProductController.java (Backend Controller)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <code>backend/src/main/java/com/wholesale/orderapp/controller/ProductController.java</code></li>
  <li><strong>Action:</strong> Created new file.</li>
  <li><strong>Endpoints:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><code>GET /api/products</code>: Returns all products with full GST breakdowns.</li>
      <li><code>GET /api/products/{id}</code>: Returns product by ID.</li>
      <li><code>POST /api/products</code>: Saves a new product and recalculates fields.</li>
      <li><code>PUT /api/products/{id}</code>: Updates existing product and recalculates fields.</li>
      <li><code>DELETE /api/products/{id}</code>: Removes product from database.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

<h3>File 4: AdminDashboard.jsx (Frontend Component)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <code>frontend/src/components/AdminDashboard.jsx</code></li>
  <li><strong>Action:</strong> Modified.</li>
  <li><strong>Key Additions:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Added <code>products</code> state and fetched data from <code>/api/products</code> on load.</li>
      <li>Added real-time calculation preview helper <code>calculateTaxBreakdown()</code>.</li>
      <li>Built the "+ Add Product" modal with real-time tax breakdown card.</li>
      <li>Built the products table displaying #, Name, HSN Code, Net Rate (₹), Tax (GST %), Rate (Excl. Tax), CGST Value, SGST Value, and Actions (Edit, Delete).</li>
      <li>Streamlined UI per user request by removing the Active Tax Slabs card, Wholesale Rule card, and the tax filter pill buttons.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

<h3>File 5: Dashboard.css (Frontend Styles)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <code>frontend/src/components/Dashboard.css</code></li>
  <li><strong>Action:</strong> Modified.</li>
  <li><strong>Key Additions:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Styled table headers and cells with color-coded currency formatting (cyan for Net Rate, emerald for Base Rate, amber for CGST/SGST).</li>
      <li>Styled HSN badges with monospace fonts.</li>
      <li>Styled GST tags displaying split percentages (e.g. 18% (9.0% + 9.0%)).</li>
      <li>Added modal inputs with embedded currency symbols (₹ and %).</li>
      <li>Added interactive quick-select tax chips (0%, 5%, 12%, 18%, 28%).</li>
      <li>Added live breakdown preview card with auto-computed tags.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

<h3>File 6: EmployeeDashboard.jsx (Frontend Component)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <code>frontend/src/components/EmployeeDashboard.jsx</code></li>
  <li><strong>Action:</strong> Modified.</li>
  <li><strong>Key Additions:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Connected to backend APIs <code>/api/products</code>, <code>/api/cities</code>, and <code>/api/shops</code>.</li>
      <li>Updated employee order flow to search real products by name or HSN code.</li>
      <li>Converted currency display from '$' to '₹'.</li>
      <li>Added columns for HSN code, Net Rate, Tax GST%, and Rate before tax.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

